OL,3,GNEWSAParalympian wants to thank crash
OL,4,Adriver 44 years after accident took his
OL,5,Aleg
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who lost his leg after being hit
OL,8,Fby a car as a 10-year-old has said he
OL,9,Fwants to thank the driver for changing
OL,10,Fhis life "for the better".
OL,12,FMark Williams went on to become a world
OL,13,Fchampion swimmer and won a silver medal
OL,14,Fat the 1988 Seoul Paralympics before
OL,15,Fsetting up his own company.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
