OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAParalympian wants to thank crash
OL,4,Adriver 44 years after accident took his
OL,5,Aleg
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said the unknown driver of the car
OL,8,Fthat hit him as he cycled home in June
OL,9,F1982 might now be in his 80s and could
OL,10,Fbe "traumatised" by what happened, but
OL,11,Fwanted him to know that "amazing
OL,12,Fthings" had happened to him as a
OL,13,Fresult.
OL,15,F"My biggest fear is that he doesn't
OL,16,Fknow my story. I just want him to send
OL,17,Fme a message, just get in contact," he
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
